# ==========================================
# AI Code Assistant Exclusion Rules (.aiexclude / .cursorignore)
# Prevents Trae, Workbuddy, Cursor, Copilot, and LLM indexing agents
# from scanning private core engine logic or creating RAG embeddings.
# ==========================================

# 1. Ignore Core Private Engine Implementations
backend/app/engine/core_private/
backend/app/engine/*_internal.py
backend/app/engine/private/
*.so
*.pyd
*.pyc

# 2. Ignore Sensitive Architecture Manuals & Reports
*深度审查与对标评估报告*
*私密*
*.key
*.pem
.env*
